From 8a897f443a4f0b68a9d0ef8fff86502abc63e5de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JorreFog <305496122+JorreFog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:13:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] es-rgds-lockdown: hide settings that break ROCKNIXDS,
 verified themes only, ROCKNIXDS updates

Leaves out the dual-screen layout options (bottom screen content, display mode, this device is), the
global and per-DS-system CPU/GPU governors, video mode and screen rotation, multiscreens, the frontend
developer options, factory reset and the standalone emulator config reset (it wipes DraStic's folder),
the DS system's emulator choice, the theme downloader and ROCKNIX's own OS updates. The theme list offers
only the themes in /storage/.config/rocknixds/themes.allow. UPDATES & DOWNLOADS gets a ROCKNIXDS section
(installed version, stable/beta channel, automatic checks, check now + install) driven by
/storage/.config/rocknixds/rocknixds-update, and a ROCKNIX (BASE SYSTEM) section for the ROCKNIX nightly under
ROCKNIXDS (rocknixds.os: the nightly verified for ROCKNIXDS, the latest one or one picked from the list; installed
and verified versions; update now, with a warning for an unverified nightly, then reboot now or later) driven by
rocknixds-update's os-current, os-verified, os-list, os-check and os-install. touch
/storage/.config/rocknixds/unlocked shows everything.
